    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Co-founder of UNSTATED (Zurich, est. 2023) alongside Sabrina Cerea; solo practice predates that. Described as graphic designer, coder and art director. Approximately mid-to-senior level with 10+ years of visible practice (Swiss Design Awards 2022, Ars Electronica 2021, Milan Design Week 2024). Teaches at ECAL, ZHDK, HSLU and SUPSI, which signals high standing in Swiss design education circles. Clients include Mammut, On Running, B&B Italia, Bauhaus Dessau and Fotomuseum Winterthur. Codes and designs websites (Latest Websites section on personal site). Work Status: Studio confirmed by co-founder role at UNSTATED (email domain unstated.co) and website context. Autonomy 4: runs his own studio, sets creative direction, teaches; capable of working independently with minimal briefing.",
